Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FallingObjectOnRoad" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Falling cylindrical object on road" .

:evidence1 a :FallingObjectIndicator ;
    :description "Cylindrical object rolling across the lane" ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1, :risk2 .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of collision with falling object" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of reduced visibility due to fog and object" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of road obstruction by foreign object" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.9"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.8"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Risk of collision with falling object
Severity Score: 0.9

**Risk 2:**
Description: Risk of reduced visibility due to fog and object
Severity Score: 0.75

**Risk 3:**
Description: Risk of road obstruction by foreign object
Severity Score: 0.8